From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ipa: simple: add a tuning file for the GC2145

Like the OV5648 and GC02M2 before it, the PinePhone front camera falls back
to uncalibrated.yaml and has its black level re-guessed from the histogram
on every exposure change.

Pin the pedestal. Measured on a PinePhone with the sensor covered and face
down on a matt black surface, six SBGGR8 frames at 1600x1200, the last two
sampled over 120000 pixels each:

  frame  B      Gb     Gr     R      all
  3      2.440  2.329  2.243  2.126  2.285
  4      2.425  2.300  2.211  2.140  2.269

so 2.28 in the sensor's 8-bit output, with a per-channel spread of about
0.3 LSB - small enough for one pedestal - and a maximum of 9..12, i.e. a
genuinely dark frame rather than a clipped one.

Note this sensor is nothing like the GC02M2 here: the GC2145 already
subtracts most of its pedestal internally, leaving ~2.3/255 where the
GC02M2 leaves 64/1023. And its raw output is 8-bit, so the conversion to
the 16-bit units this file uses is x256, not the x64 that applies to a
10-bit sensor:

  2.28 / 255 -> 2.28 * 256 = 583

No colour correction matrix, for the same reason as the OV5648 and the
GC02M2: it has to be measured, not borrowed.

Upstream-Status: Pending

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
---
--- a/src/ipa/simple/data/meson.build
+++ b/src/ipa/simple/data/meson.build
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0
 
 conf_files = files([
+    'gc2145.yaml',
     'gc02m2.yaml',
     'ov5648.yaml',
     'uncalibrated.yaml',
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/ipa/simple/data/gc2145.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0
+%YAML 1.1
+---
+version: 1
+algorithms:
+  - BlackLevel:
+      # Measured with the sensor covered on a PinePhone: SBGGR8 dark frames
+      # average 2.28 of 255 (per-channel 2.13..2.44). The sensor does its own
+      # black level correction, so little is left. 8-bit raw, so the pedestal
+      # in the 16-bit units this file uses is 2.28 * 256 -> 583.
+      blackLevel: 583
+  - Awb:
+  # A colour correction matrix belongs here once it has been measured
+  # against a colour chart with utils/tuning:
+  #
+  #   - Ccm:
+  #       ccms:
+  #         - ct: 6500
+  #           ccm: [ ... ]
+  - Adjust:
+  - Agc:
+...
